  "question": {
    "text": "An electron revolves in a circular orbit of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math> with angular speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi></math>. The magnetic field at the centre of electron orbit is",
